    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Then it’ll be a short membership."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Dev takes the card anyway. Pockets it like it matters,"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "because it does."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "DEV"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "What happens to all of it?"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Margo looks down the aisles. Twenty thousand tapes. A"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "lifetime of other people’s Friday nights."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "MARGO"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Somebody buys the shelves. The rest"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "goes where the rest goes."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "DEV"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "That’s grim."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "MARGO"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "(not grim at all)"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "It’s Tuesday."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "SMASH CUT TO:"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "INT. DEV’S APARTMENT - NIGHT"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "A television old enough to have a dial. Dev threads the tape"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "in. Static, then a countdown leader -- 5, 4, 3."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "His NIECE, 14, arms folded, sits as far from the screen as"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "the room allows."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "NIECE"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "This is going to be so boring."
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "DEV"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "Forty minutes. Give it forty"
    },
    {
     "op": "showText",
     "text": "minutes."
    }
   ],
